            <https://w3id.org/laad/id/cc-14-18/afirmacion/A-UT09-502>,
            <https://w3id.org/laad/id/cc-14-18/afirmacion/A-UT09-520>,
            <https://w3id.org/laad/id/cc-14-18/afirmacion/A-UT10-506>,
            <https://w3id.org/laad/id/cc-14-18/afirmacion/A-UT17-003>,
            <https://w3id.org/laad/id/cc-14-18/afirmacion/A-UT19-806> ;
